            "prompt": "Create the RelaySwitcher Desktop Dashboard using the Neural Noir design system. \n\nLayout:\n- Background: Dark background with a radial dot-grid (32px mesh, white 8%).\n- Left Sidebar (220px): Glassmorphism (backdrop-blur-xl). Top brand text 'RelaySwitcher' in Playfair Display Italic (Gold #a78b71). Navigation items: 仪表盘 (Dashboard), 账号 (Account), 中转站 (Relays), 备份 (Backup), 设置 (Settings). Active item has a gold left border and gold text. Bottom status pill with a green breathing dot '已绑定中转站'.\n- Main Header: '仪表盘' in H1, small gold 'DASHBOARD' label above, and a 'refresh' icon button.\n- Stat Cards: 4 glassmorphic cards (ACCOUNT, RELAY, MODEL, STATUS) with small gold uppercase labels. Values: bec***@mail.com (Badge: Free), api.zeniths.codes (Badge: 42ms), gpt-6-astra (Badge: 目录已接管), Active (Badge: 快速模式 ON).\n- Central Panel (一键切换): Steps 01 选择账号, 02 选择中转站, 03 模型. Three dropdowns connected by gold lines. '上下文窗口' section with chips (372000, 272K, 372K, 872K). '快速模式' toggle. Main CTA: Full-width white button '立即切换' with gold hover glow.\n- Log Box: Darker glass box (rgba(0,0,0,0.35)) with JetBrains Mono font. Green checkmarks for completed steps like '初始化系统状态... OK'.\n- Bottom Bar: Slim bar with 'System Backup: Synchronized 2m ago' and a gold outline button '⟲ 一键回滚'.\n\nStyle: \n- Strict Neural Noir: Dark #0a0a0a base, Primary Gold #a78b71 for accents, Glassmorphism everywhere. \n- Simplified Chinese text. \n- High-precision instrumentation feel.",
