      "text": "The RelaySwitcher dashboard has been meticulously crafted following the **Neural Noir** design system.\n\n### Key Design Decisions:\n- **Cockpit Architecture**: Implemented a high-precision layout with a 220px glassmorphic sidebar and a central \"One-Click Switch\" control panel to evoke the feeling of a professional developer workstation.\n- **Glassmorphism & Texture**: Utilized semi-transparent surfaces with backdrop blurring over a radial dot-grid background, creating depth without visual clutter.\n- **Precision Typography**: Paired *Playfair Display Italic* for the brand identity with *JetBrains Mono* for system logs to balance elegance with technical utility.\n- **Sparse Gold Accents**: Reserved the signature primary gold for critical state indicators, active navigation borders, and structural connections between the 3-step workflow dropdowns.\n- **Context-Aware Interactions**: Included specific developer-centric elements like context window chips (up to 872K) and a green breathing status dot for real-time feedback.\n\nThe interface is fully localized in **Simplified Chinese** and optimized for a desktop form factor."
